Luxembourg: Michelle Caruso-Cabrera) The emergency meeting in Luxembourg of European Union finance ministers and Britain\u2019s bailout plan in response to the decline in price of the Royal Bank of Scotland featured. The likelihood of global interest rate cuts discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Brian Williams) Report introduced.  \n\n(Washington: Lisa Myers) Congressional hearings about the lavish vacation taken by former AIG CEOs Martin Sullivan&#134; and Robert Willumstad&#134; after taxpayers bailed out the insurance company featured; scenes shown of the St. Regis resort in California and from the hearings; the cost of the retreat and Sullivan\u2019s compensation cited; details given about the continuing payment to consultant Joe Cassano&#134;. [Representatives Elijah CUMMINGS&#134;, Mark SOUDER&#134;- criticize the CEOs.] [SULLIVAN \u2013 says he is not considering giving back any money.] [Representative Jackie SPEIER&#134;- thanks Willumstad for forgoing his golden parachute; says shame on Sullivan.] The FBI investigation of AIG noted. ", "segment_duration": 480, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920080, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Nv01Kss8DB", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-07", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920079, "segment_id": "oYWNCiePwo", "segment_broadcast_id": "Nv01Kss8DB", "segment_title": "Decision 2008 / Obama vs. McCain / Nashville Debate", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) Tonight's presidential debate between Senators John McCain and Barack Obama introduced; live scenes shown of the debate hall in Nashville.   (Nashvil